  m_text: "Bananas contain natural fructose, which your body digests slowly thanks
    to the fiber inside the fruit. One banana has around 14g of natural sugar (3.5
    teaspoons), but because it\u2019s packaged with nutrients like potassium and
    vitamins, it gives steady energy instead of a sugar spike."
